  "honestFindings": [
    "The exact legacy tasks.create.input/v2 Task decoder already accepts dependsOn. Version 3 added Task admission and raisedBy, not dependsOn.",
    "Both exact older decoders reject a current Task that carries admission and raisedBy. They reject those excess fields deterministically and do not silently accept version 3.",
    "The public 0.1.14 package is Station protocol 5 only. It has no overlap with protocol 1 and returns a non-retryable no-common-version preface rejection before session or Work decode.",
    "The checked decoder bundles are exact-archive build outputs or an instrumented derivative of released compiled bytes. None is mislabeled as a released package.",
    "There is no released older Remote artifact. Native released-Remote pairing remains for the dedicated later qualification task."
  ],
